          "value": "<p><strong>Area Attack.</strong> Each creature of the wraith's choice within 4 squares rolls <strong>Resolve</strong> vs DC 15. Hit: <code>4d6</code> psychic + soul; half on success. On a failure, the target is also slowed until the end of its next turn (movement halved, no reactions, action OR bonus action — not both).<br/><em>Recharges on a Soma Break.</em></p><p><em>A second too late, a second too early — both happen to you at once.</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
